{[character]agentID.name}

132306.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Because of your failure to deal with the stockpiles in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, the Minmatar managed to escape back to their Republic with the stolen freight. You are not the only capsuleer, {[character]player.name}, and I‘d remind you to remember who pays your bills. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132306.es:
{[character]player.name}: <br><br>

Debido a tu fracaso a la hora de lidiar con las reservas de {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, los minmatarianos han logrado escapar a su República con el cargamento robado. Hay más capsulistas que podrían encargarse de esto, {[character]player.name}, y te recuerdo quién te da de comer. <br><br>

{[character]agentID.name}

132307.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another mercenary squadron to deal with the Minmatar complex in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, and not without considerable losses. Fortunately, you are not the only capable capsuleer working in our sovereignty. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132307.es:
{[character]player.name}: <br><br>

Tu despreocupación me obligó a contratar a otro escuadrón de mercenarios para lidiar con el complejo minmatariano en {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}, no sin pérdidas considerables. Por suerte, hay más capsulistas en nuestro territorio. <br><br>

{[character]agentID.name}

132407.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Unfortunately, given the amount of time that has passed since we last met, the Caldari mothership we discussed has now left {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} and rejoined its fleet. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132407.es:
{[character]player.name}: <br><br>

Por desgracia, dado el tiempo transcurrido desde la última vez que nos reunimos, la nave nodriza caldari de la que hablamos ya ha salido de {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} y se ha reunido con su flota. <br><br>

{[character]agentID.name}

132408.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another capsuleer to deal with the Caldari ship we discussed. Having had little time to prepare for the task, however, that pilot lost his ship and barely escaped in his pod. Thanks for your (lack of) effort. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132408.es:
{[character]player.name}: <br><br>

Ya que no respondiste, me tuve que buscar otro capsulista para que se encargara de la nave caldari de la que hablamos. Sin embargo, al haber tenido poco tiempo para prepararse para la tarea, ese piloto perdió su nave y apenas pudo escapar en su cápsula. Gracias por tu (falta de) esfuerzo. <br><br>

{[character]agentID.name}

