132425.en:
{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Due to your lack of response, I was forced to find another capsuleer to deal with the Gallente ship we discussed. Having had little time to prepare for the task, however, that pilot lost his ship and barely escaped in his pod. If only you had moved more quickly to eliminate the threat... <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132425.es:
