132983.en:
My scouts inform me that a Serpentis fleet has arrived to reinforce their station in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name}. They must‘ve caught wind of our plan. I‘m calling the mission off ― it would be suicide to go in there now. <br><br>
I'm sure you had good reason for not going in there right away, but we lost a good opportunity here. <br><br>
{[character]agentID.name}

132983.es:
