{[character]player.name}, <br><br>
Fortunately,  the Navy arrived in time to deal with the Amarr battle station in {[location]dungeonLocationID.name} before it was fully armed and supplied. Lady Luck was with us on this one ... even if you weren‘t. <br><br>
