550005.en:
There has been a development in the war between {declaredByName} and {againstName}. 

{quitterName} is no longer a member of {allianceName}, and therefore a new war between {opponentName} and {quitterName} has begun. This war is subject to all the standard CONCORD rules for formal capsuleer warfare including war eligibility, war bills, and war headquarters. If any of the standard war requirements are not met the war will be declared invalid and enter a cooldown period.

{allyText}

550005.es:
Se ha producido un acontecimiento en la guerra entre {declaredByName} y {againstName}. 


{quitterName} ya no pertenece a {allianceName} y, por tanto, ha estallado una nueva guerra entre {opponentName} y {quitterName}. Este conflicto está sujeto a todas las normas de CONCORD para los enfrentamientos formales de capsulistas, incluidos los criterios de participación, las facturas bélicas y el cuartel general de guerra. Si no se cumple alguno de estos requisitos estándar, la guerra se declarará nula y entrará en un periodo apaciguador.


{allyText}

550253.en:
The war between {declaredByName} and {againstName} has been retracted by CONCORD as the appropriate bills for the conflict were not paid.

After {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short} CONCORD will again respond to any hostilities between those involved with full force.

{signOff}

550253.es:
CONCORD ha revocado la guerra entre {declaredByName} y {againstName} puesto que las facturas correspondientes al conflicto no están abonadas.


A partir del {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short}, CONCORD responderá a todas las hostilidades entre las partes implicadas con todo su poderío militar.


{signOff}

550282.en:
The war between {declaredByName} and {againstName} has been retracted by CONCORD because at least one of the involved parties has become ineligible for war declarations.

Fighting must cease on {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short}.

{signOff}

550282.es:
CONCORD ha revocado la guerra entre {declaredByName} y {againstName} porque al menos una de las partes involucradas ya no es apta para declarar guerras.


La lucha debe cesar el {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short}.


{signOff}

561662.en:
The war between {declaredByName} and {againstName} is coming to an end. The war headquarters {warHQ} chosen by {declaredByName} are in a solar system that is no longer fully protected by CONCORD. The war will be declared as being over after approximately 24 hours.

After {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short} CONCORD will again respond to any hostilities between those involved with full force.

{signOff}

561662.es:
La guerra entre {declaredByName} y {againstName} ha concluido. El cuartel general de guerra {warHQ}, elegido por {declaredByName}, está en un sistema solar que ya no goza de la protección de CONCORD. Se declarará el fin de la guerra en unas 24 horas.


A partir del {[datetime]endDate, date=full, time=short}, CONCORD responderá a todas las hostilidades entre los involucrados con todo su poder.


{signOff}

